WEBVTT

00:07:29.320 --> 00:07:33.741
but there is one more
uncomfortable thing we have to do.

00:07:34.950 --> 00:07:36.702
Be nice to each other.

00:07:36.702 --> 00:07:38.204
(Laughter)

00:07:38.496 --> 00:07:39.872
Kindness.

00:07:40.456 --> 00:07:41.624
Sure, you say.

00:07:41.624 --> 00:07:46.295
But in the moment, isn't it easier
throwing someone else under the bus?

00:07:47.588 --> 00:07:50.299
And have you tried the opposite of kind,

00:07:50.299 --> 00:07:52.384
the unkind leader,

00:07:52.426 --> 00:07:56.555
the one who happily shares
blame but not shine?

00:07:57.348 --> 00:07:59.934
Or the pretend kind leader.

00:07:59.975 --> 00:08:04.855
Like, “I know it’s Friday afternoon,
and I need this by Monday 8 am.